st fearsome creatures, claim materials found nowhere else, and free Embervale from the Shroud's grip. <br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1203620/extras/870186393391e3f40602602bc6efacd1.poster.avif?t=1792078032\" width=780 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1203620/extras/870186393391e3f40602602bc6efacd1.webm?t=1792078032\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1203620/extras/870186393391e3f40602602bc6efacd1.mp4?t=1792078032\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FORGE YOUR LEGEND - SOLO OR WITH FRIENDS</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Walk this path alone or in co-op with up to 16 players. Fight, build, farm, or explore: every role matters in rebuilding the kingdom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1203620/extras/8fb3f236662088659545a154c900a43d.poster.avif?t=1792078032\" width=780 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1203620/extras/8fb3f236662088659545a154c900a43d.webm?t=1792078032\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1203620/extras/8fb3f236662088659545a154c900a43d.mp4?t=1792078032\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DISCOVER ENDLESS ADVENTURES</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When the campaign ends, your story doesn't. Dive into worlds and dungeons created by millions of players, or share your own through our Adventure Sharing feature.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"